Not covered: [38;5;10mpng_longjmp[0m / [38;5;10mpng_set_longjmp_fn[0m's actual non-local jump, which needs [38;5;10msetjmp[0m and cannot be driven safely from Rust; only the returned pointer and [38;5;10mpng_free_jmpbuf[0m are checked.[0m[0m
